<main class="page-wrap about-page"><div class="page-intro"><p class="eyebrow">Learning feels better together</p><h1>A simpler way to learn, teach and grow.</h1><p>MAAK brings families and university student-teachers together through accessible, high-quality recorded courses.</p></div><div class="steps-grid about-steps"><article><span class="step-icon">⌕</span><b>01</b><h3>Find a course</h3><p>Explore subjects and choose a course that fits your learner’s needs.</p></article><article><span class="step-icon">▷</span><b>02</b><h3>Learn at your pace</h3><p>Follow recorded lessons whenever it works for your family.</p></article><article><span class="step-icon">✧</span><b>03</b><h3>See the progress</h3><p>Parents can follow every child’s learning journey from one account.</p></article></div><section class="about-family"><h2>Designed around families</h2><p>One parent account can manage multiple child profiles. A course purchase is shared across the family, while progress remains individual for each child.</p><a class="button button-primary" href="{{ path('app_register_parent') }}">Create a parent account →</a></section></main>
